          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "An Irish caravan park and tourism business that needed bookings to grow every season and the shoulder season to stop being empty."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A sharp summer peak, an empty spring and autumn, and competitors with bigger ad budgets. Every season started from zero."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "SEO for caravan park, camping and attraction searches in the area",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Seasonal Google Ads strategy that spends early and pulls back once organic takes over",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Content on things to do nearby, which brings the shoulder-season traffic",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Review management programme",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Organic bookings have grown every season since the engagement began, and the shoulder season is now a third of annual revenue."
        }
      ]
